---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Our Services &mdash; Modular Kitchens, Wardrobes &amp; Construction"
description: "Discover our core services at MITRA: Modular Kitchens, Wardrobes, false ceilings, complete home renovations, commercial space design, and villa construction."
---

{% block extraCss %}
  <link rel="preload" href="/css/pages/services.css" as="style" onload="this.onload=null;this.rel='stylesheet'"><noscript><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/pages/services.css"></noscript>
{% endblock %}

<!-- SERVICES HERO -->
    <section class="services-hero">
      <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:1;">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold);">Scope of Work</span>
        <h1><span>Designed Without </span><span>Compromise.</span></h1>
        <p style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8); max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; font-size:17px;">From cabinetry fabrication to foundation engineering. Explore our specialized services built with transparent cost parameters.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SERVICES LIST -->
    <section class="wrap services-grid">
      
      <!-- 1. Modular Kitchen -->
      <div class="service-item-card reveal" id="kitchens">
        <div class="s-card-img">
          {% image "images/external/ext_d8e42ed6.jpg", "L-shape modern kitchen", "100vw", "", "auto" %}
        </div>
        <div class="s-card-body">
          <h3>Modular Kitchens</h3>
          <p>L-shape, U-shape, straight and parallel layouts engineered to optimize kitchen ergonomics. Manufactured with moisture-proof BWP plywood and soft-close hardware.</p>
          <div class="s-card-footer" style="justify-content: flex-end;">
            <a href="/modular-kitchens.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 13px;">View Designs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Wardrobes -->
      <div class="service-item-card reveal delay-1" id="wardrobes">
        <div class="s-card-img">
          {% image "images/external/ext_b85b5fb2.jpg", "Sliding glass wardrobe", "100vw", "", "auto" %}
        </div>
        <div class="s-card-body">
          <h3>Wardrobes</h3>
          <p>Custom sliding and swing-door wardrobes built with robust inner partitions, soft-close sliders, and elegant laminate/acrylic exterior panel selections.</p>
          <div class="s-card-footer" style="justify-content: flex-end;">
            <a href="/wardrobes.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 13px;">View Designs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. False Ceilings -->
      <div class="service-item-card reveal delay-2" id="ceilings">
        <div class="s-card-img">
          {% image "images/external/ext_763dcaab.jpg", "Minimal false ceiling with LED profiles", "100vw", "", "auto" %}
        </div>
        <div class="s-card-body">
          <h3>False Ceilings</h3>
          <p>Gypsum and POP ceilings integrating warm cove illumination, spotlight cuts, and acoustic panels to define the modern room experience.</p>
          <div class="s-card-footer" style="justify-content: flex-end;">
            <a href="/false-ceilings.html" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 13px;">View Designs</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

